{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spencer's Spaghetti Quest is a fast-paced 3D platforming puzzle-solving shooter, made up entirely of hand drawn sprites. There are various little things around the map you can collect that will make you a bit stronger, and a bunch of fun movement mechanics to mess around with. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877570/extras/970cb8ec1ffdecfc7081ecc40eec06ed.poster.avif?t=1764705736\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877570/extras/970cb8ec1ffdecfc7081ecc40eec06ed.webm?t=1764705736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot magic bolts from your fingers, stretch out your arm and punch enemies far away, or use it to launch yourself and reach hard to get areas.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877570/extras/e8a7f837d8a622f1f732edf9afe383fa.poster.avif?t=1764705736\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877570/extras/e8a7f837d8a622f1f732edf9afe383fa.webm?t=1764705736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877570/extras/e8a7f837d8a622f1f732edf9afe383fa.mp4?t=1764705736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877570/extras/1005197480caa967a1f9f0f90e9254fb.poster.avif?t=1764705736\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877570/extras/1005197480caa967a1f9f0f90e9254fb.webm?t=1764705736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be a variety of puzzles, NPC's to interact with, plenty of enemies, and tons of random wacky antics! Many of the character's you'll see were made and submitted by community members!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877570/extras/8ed8975b500b7beed515032f4c63b908.avif?t=1764705736\" width=807 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get different costumes by playing the game, some which will be exclusive to early access players and discord members!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877570/extras/2000c351efc98925ed59ac4560a93bfb.poster.avif?t=1764705736\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877570/extras/2000c351efc98925ed59ac4560a93bfb.webm?t=1764705736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featured Content Creators<br>BunBuns :\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"WTF!?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3877570/597159b898b5b67fb69ea4e46650236258491bea.jpg"},{"name":"THICC","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3877570/380543545fc19ac94900eb97567493df9f16c28b.jpg"},{"name":"SpEcEr WiNz","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3877570/e0df5ac2dc5bcce152f7324ef01208d7d5f6cce0.jpg"},{"name":"BUTT FIEND","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.c